<title>HONG KONG: Chevalier Int'l interim net up 67.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Chevalier Int'l interim net up 67.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 14.17    vs  8.71</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  4.5	vs  4.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	nil	vs  24.07 loss</p>
<p>    Net			  104.08   vs  62.20</p>
<p>    Turnover		   2,190.48 vs  2,802.91</p>
<p>    Company name	     Chevalier International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		January 6-10</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 February 12</p>
<p>NOTE - Chevalier International is an installer of air-conditioning systems, escalators and industrial equipment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
